&lt;li&gt;Lead&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;complex deal cycles&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and coordinate internal teams (pre-sales, product, partners)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage the partner ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to drive pipeline and support deal execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;enterprise agreements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;pipeline discipline and forecast accuracy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
