&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a mixed methods role, but we are open to applications from candidates who have a primarily quantitative background. A Senior Consultant&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;(SC) in the Strategy team plays a pivotal role in managing the day-to-day delivery of client projects. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
